  "job_C16.2_20251003_115216": {
    "chunk_text": "mona se twelfta, on Puer natus bonus, amabilis; signum in manu dextera habet uel in genu; periculosus cild acenned god, Puella signum in mamilla habet; speciosa, sed non diuturnam uitam agit m\u00e6den tacn on breoste h\u00e6f\u00f0; Eger uel diu languescit uel moritur seoc o\u00f0\u00f0e he lange adla\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e he swylt. Somnium est certum; securis esto swefne ys gewis; orsorh beo \u00feu. Tota die bona est luna sanguinem minuere ealne d\u00e6g god ys mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna XIII; periculosa ad incipiendas res; nec cum amicis contendas mona se \u00fereotteo\u00fea, fr\u00e6cenful to Qui fugit, cito inuenitur se\u00fee fleh\u00f0, ra\u00fee bi\u00f0 funden. Puer natus animosus, signum circa oculos habens, audax, rapax, superbus, sibi soli placens; non longe Puella signum in ceruice habet uel in femore; superba, animosa, temeraria in corpore cum multis Eger cito euadit uel diu languescit seoc ra\u00f0e \u00e6twint o\u00f0\u00f0e lange he hadla\u00f0. Somnium infra dies IX completur swefn binnan dagum nigon bi\u00f0 gefylled. Ab hora VI usque sero bona luna sanguinem minuere fram tide \u00feere syxtan god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna XIIII, omnibus bonis rebus bona; mancipia emere, uxorem ducere, pueros in scola mittere mona Puer natus mercator; signum circa oculos uel in femore habet; audax, superbus, sibi soli placens; cito Puella signum in uertice habet; superba, temeraria, multos uiros desiderans;",
